# The `tests` package — every suite that ships inside the image.
#
# ONE list, three consumers: `macvm-gui test` (the command line), the Tests
# tab (via `PRIMARY_LISTS`, cocoa_gui/src/boot.rs), and `tests/it_world.rs`
# (cargo). There used to be a second list under world/tests/ that only cargo
# read, which meant the 549-test library corpus was invisible to the GUI and
# to anyone running `macvm-gui test` — the suite looked like 23 tests when it
# was really 572.
#
# There is NO driver file here. Suites are found by reflection
# (`TestRunner runAll`), so a driver would only be a second list to keep in
# step — and a driver that ends in `Smalltalk quit:` must never load inside
# the GUI, which would quit the app.

# SUnit's own suite, and the VM guarantees a Smalltalker's code rests on.
t10_sunit_tests.mst
t11_vm_semantics_tests.mst

